"""Approximate a mostly document-initial lexical response.

Outside onset, predict zero except for the colon in an initial 'Title:'.
At onset, named grammatical classes set the response. Other ASCII word-like
tokens receive a spelling score: p/k/b/m lower it, v raises it, with case
and length corrections. Individual word-specific amplitudes remain unmodeled.
